ximate status and query invalidation in Ch. 6/Core 0. Debt, lot and cohort counterexamples are given; a general equivalence checker or empirical approximate-cohort error bound is not established. G1, G16. |\\n78:| MC14 | Give scenarios and decision information explicit meanings. U2, P, D. | Define supported exogenous stress, observational-conditioning and intervention modes, or explicitly scope unsupported modes; enforce information dates and distinguish real-world from pricing measures. | Specified exogenous stress, observational conditioning, intervention preconditions and information capabilities in Ch. 8/Core 0. Finite conditioning, an information-date example and debt stress typing/provenance are checked; causal intervention execution and arbitrary information-policy enforcement remain pending. G6, G14. |\\n140:plan; v1 evidence remains preserved. This advances MC01, MC03, MC05, MC19–22,\\n{\\n  \\\"schema_version\\\": \\\"accdsl.p06.context-chronology-cases.v1\\\",\\n  \\\"contexts\\\": {\\n    \\\"usd_local\\\": {\\\"concept\\\":\\\"revenue\\\",\\\"entity\\\":\\\"Acme\\\",\\\"perimeter\\\":\\\"Acme\\\",\\\"perimeter_version\\\":\\\"2026\\\",\\\"basis\\\":\\\"GAAP\\\",\\\"measurement\\\":\\\"historical_cost\\\",\\\"unit\\\":\\\"USD\\\",\\\"currency\\\":\\\"USD\\\",\\\"calendar\\\":\\\"gregorian\\\",\\\"dimensions\\\":{\\\"segment\\\":\\\"retail\\\"},\\\"gross_net\\\":\\\"gross\\\"},\\n    \\\"usd_group\\\": {\\\"concept\\\":\\\"revenue\\\",\\\"entity\\\":\\\"Acme\\\",\\\"perimeter\\\":\\\"Group\\\",\\\"perimeter_version\\\":\\\"2026\\\",\\\"basis\\\":\\\"GAAP\\\",\\\"measurement\\\":\\\"historical_cost\\\",\\\"unit\\\":\\\"USD\\\",\\\"currency\\\":\\\"USD\\\",\\\"calendar\\\":\\\"gregorian\\\",\\\"dimensions\\\":{\\\"segment\\\":\\\"retail\\\"},\\\"gross_net\\\":\\\"gross\\\"}\\n  },\\n  \\\"assertions\\\": [\\n    {\\\"id\\\":\\\"h1-original\\\",\\\"concept\\\":\\\"sales\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"120\\\",\\\"period\\\":{\\\"start\\\":\\\"2025-01-01\\\",\\\"end\\\