on is a shared interpretation error in the synthetic fixtures; independent set and arithmetic probes reduce that risk but do not replace source or professional review. The weakest evidence is breadth: mappings, uncertainty, and grouping are finite bounded cases.\n\nResiduals: general measurement conversion, consolidation, arbitrary calendars, continuous or nonlinear uncertainty, empirical approximation validation, historical retained-byte availability, accounting validity, forecast validity, and human acceptance remain open. This phase does not rank stochastic candidates or establish a production default.\n\nActual command: `CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python3 -B scripts/check_accounting_p06.py --output-dir data/accounting-master/deliverables/P06 --approved-plan data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T233421-cea9e631/P06/approved-plan.json --execution-inventory data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T233421-cea9e631/P06/execution-1/pre-edit-files.json`. Python 3.11.15, CPU only with accelerator devices intentionally hidden. Wall time: 4.138707 seconds. Git provenance is unavailable; content hashes and supervisor inventories are retained in conformance.json.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
